1
00:00:00,166 --> 00:00:01,501
I have cash to burn.

2
00:00:02,252 --> 00:00:03,461
Nobody can touch me.

3
00:00:04,045 --> 00:00:05,964
Ted! Back to your 
sideline now.

4
00:00:07,632 --> 00:00:08,091
Good job.

5
00:00:08,091 --> 00:00:09,300
Got your cash later 
by the way.

6
00:00:12,721 --> 00:00:13,471
You're talented.

7
00:00:14,723 --> 00:00:15,515
Big fucking deal.

8
00:00:16,349 --> 00:00:17,142
One word from me,

9
00:00:17,142 --> 00:00:19,185
Henry gets you fired for leaking my plays.

10
00:00:20,645 --> 00:00:23,231
The world belongs to people like us.

11
00:00:23,982 --> 00:00:25,108
Nice little sweater 
by the way.

12
00:00:25,525 --> 00:00:26,192
Good look.

13
00:00:27,318 --> 00:00:27,694
Crawling back,

14
00:00:27,694 --> 00:00:28,737
I think she's calling you.

15
00:00:36,411 --> 00:00:37,454
Let's go.

16
00:00:40,123 --> 00:00:42,917
Eagles! Fight!
Fight! Fight!

17
00:00:43,168 --> 00:00:45,920
The Eagles have taken the lead swiftly,

18
00:00:45,920 --> 00:00:48,506
and there's only ten minutes left on the clock.

19
00:00:48,673 --> 00:00:50,008
Looks as though 
the Knights

20
00:00:50,008 --> 00:00:51,801
might not pull off the miracle today.

21
00:00:52,510 --> 00:00:54,512
Three of our key players are out.

22
00:00:54,512 --> 00:00:56,389
If this keeps up, 
we're finished.

23
00:00:56,806 --> 00:00:58,808
West obviously 
bribed the refs.

24
00:00:58,892 --> 00:00:59,934
Unless we can 
find someone

25
00:00:59,934 --> 00:01:01,686
who's good enough to dodge hits and score,

26
00:01:01,686 --> 00:01:02,645
we're done for.

27
00:01:03,480 --> 00:01:04,731
Come on, coach, somebody like that

28
00:01:04,731 --> 00:01:06,024
is top-tier at least.

29
00:01:06,441 --> 00:01:07,442
We're in the middle of a damn game.

30
00:01:07,442 --> 00:01:09,069
How are we supposed to find someone like that?

31
00:01:16,951 --> 00:01:18,161
Alright, Ted, warm up.

32
00:01:20,663 --> 00:01:22,165
Only you can save the Knights now.
